      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغلمهُ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a thing) <i>excited his lust,</i> or <i>appetence.</i> (K, * TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغلم</span> said of a beverage,
<i>It strengthened in the venereal faculty.</i> (TA in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اول</span>.) ＝   
